    <Programs>
      <Program Name="MainProgram" MainRoutineName="MainRoutine" Class="Standard" Disabled="false">
        <Tags />
        <Routines>
          <Routine Name="MainRoutine" Type="RLL">
            <RLLContent>
              <Rung Number="0" Type="N">
                <Comment>Zero every represented PID field. Disable Execute before clearing, or load a valid LoopPreset in the following rung before PID runs.</Comment>
                <Text>XIC(ClearLoop)FLL(0,Loop,1);</Text>
              </Rung>
              <Rung Number="1" Type="N">
                <Comment>Copy the complete LoopPreset record before PID execution. Pulse LoadTuning for one step; leaving it true reloads CTL, settings and DATA every scan.</Comment>
                <Text>XIC(LoadTuning)CPS(LoopPreset,Loop,1);</Text>
              </Rung>
              <Rung Number="2" Type="N">
                <Comment>PID software profile. MO uses Tieback; PVTracking follows PV in manual. Inhold copies Readback to CV. NDF disables the modeled derivative smoothing filter.</Comment>
                <Text>XIC(Execute)PID(Loop,PV,Tieback,CV,0,Inhold,Readback);</Text>
              </Rung>
              <Rung Number="3" Type="N">
                <Comment>Optional INT process and control values. Set IntExecute; inspect RawPV, RawCV and IntLoop. Both loops share the external Tieback input.</Comment>
                <Text>XIC(IntExecute)PID(IntLoop,RawPV,Tieback,RawCV,Loop,IntInhold,IntReadback);</Text>
              </Rung>
              <Rung Number="4" Type="N">
                <Comment>Copy the loop's represented fields after both PID calls. This does not copy internal solver history.</Comment>
                <Text>XIC(CaptureLoop)COP(Loop,LoopSnapshot,1);</Text>
              </Rung>
              <Rung Number="5" Type="N">
                <Comment>Set FaultDivisor to zero to verify transactional rollback, then correct it and retry.</Comment>
                <Text>DIV(1,FaultDivisor,Quotient);</Text>
              </Rung>
            </RLLContent>
          </Routine>
        </Routines>
      </Program>
    </Programs>
    <Tasks>
      <Task Name="MainTask" Type="CONTINUOUS" Priority="10" Watchdog="500" Class="Standard" InhibitTask="false">
        <ScheduledPrograms>
          <ScheduledProgram Name="MainProgram" />
        </ScheduledPrograms>
      </Task>
    </Tasks>
  </Controller>
</RSLogix5000Content>
